>Oh, and something I've always wondered:  in 3.0j (Mac), how does one rename
>that minotaur that one charmed?  I've been dying to see
>
>"Junior hits the Wizard of Yendor --more--
> Junior hits the Wizard of Yendor --more--
> Junior butts the Wizard of Yendor --more--
> Junior hits the Wizard of Yendor --more--
> The Wizard of Yendor is destroyed!"

You can name any monster in the dungeon by hitting "C", then moving the cursor
to the monster and hitting "."  Actually, this is the way I usually name my
pets, liking different named pets each game.  Another fun use is for when
there's a large herd of something, like when you've #monster'd up a horde of
friends.  Name them all, it's fun :)  Or if you're really bored, name the
inhabitants of a throne room just as you step in with your ring of conflict.
Using appropriate names can make for some funny messages.

